  "overview": "Vue Design System — Crisp light (rgb(255, 255, 255)) canvas, Fira Sans typography, rgb(230, 164, 0) brand accent, and 8px corner geometry",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (rgb(255, 255, 255)) canvas paired with `rgb(255, 255, 255)` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `rgb(230, 164, 0)` with `#0b0b0c` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Fira Sans` across 7 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
